  "notes": "USAGE:\nUsed as a ⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧ verb: {起訴|きそ}⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧ (to indict, to prosecute). The passive {起訴|きそ}⟦される→する：00392_suru⟧ (to be indicted) is very common in news reporting.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {起訴|きそ}⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧: to indict, to prosecute\n- ⟦{不起訴|ふきそ}→不起訴：23352_fukiso⟧: non-indictment, decision not to prosecute\n- {起訴|きそ}⟦{猶予|ゆうよ}→猶予：13496_yuuyo⟧: suspended indictment\n- {起訴|きそ}{状|じょう}: indictment document\n\nCULTURAL NOTE:\nJapan's conviction rate after indictment exceeds 99%, so prosecutors are very selective about which cases they bring to trial. The decision to indict or not (⟦{不起訴|ふきそ}→不起訴：23352_fukiso⟧) is itself a major news event.",
